    "name": "Convex + Better Auth",
    "descriptionZh": "Convex Labs 下的一份集成文档：Convex + Better Auth 是一个 Convex Component，把 Better Auth 的认证接到 Convex 上，页面按 React (Vite SPA)、Expo (React Native)、TanStack Start、Next.js、SvelteKit 五种框架分别给安装步骤。",
    "takeawayZh": "按框架指南把 Better Auth 接进 Convex 项目。",
    "noteZh": "左侧目录从 Getting Started 一路列到 Supported Plugins、Debugging、Integrations、Experimental、API、Migrations；正文先把 Convex + Better Auth 定义成 a Convex Component that provides an integration layer for using Better Auth with Convex，Prerequisites 只两步——npm create convex@latest 建项目、npx convex dev 起 CLI，然后才是 Select your framework 的五个选项。",
